      "created_at": "2018-03-03T10:12:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Expatriette with all guns and no ammo or vice-versa. Unity with all bots and no equipment or vice-versa. The Adept if he (somehow) ends up with all instruments and no songs. Any heroes who can only deal Melée and Projectile damage (eg Legacy, or Haka in a no-target environment) versus Shu.</p>",
