      "created_at": "2018-03-03T13:18:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Expat with all guns and no ammo is a fine start. &nbsp;Play a gun and start shooting. &nbsp;It’s when you start with all ammo in hand that you don’t have much to do since Ammo can’t be played for any benefit in advance of having a gun. &nbsp;</p>",
