      "id": 214919,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-03-03T15:35:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I often don’t even bother playing ammo. They’re basically like one-shots that add a little bit of damage or damage reduction, far weaker than other heroes’ comparable one-shots and mostly worse than her own other cards. But I fail to draw any guns with her pretty often. Slightly less often, BoT Chrono-Ranger with no useful bounties or guns (who is rubbish), AZ with no modules (even worse), or Mr. Fixer with only tools or only styles (not useless but really weak). I rarely get AA with a useless card combination, but it does happen. I’ve never had a problem with Unity given the amount of card draw she gets.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:46:14.440Z",
