      "created_at": "2018-03-03T16:46:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>AZ with no modules or a way to get his modules at start of game is a bummer but he can still contribute through hs card plays. &nbsp;It moreso means that unless you’re F6/F5 AZ you won’t be using the base power. &nbsp;Mostly it means you aren’t getting the maximum potential out of his damaging one shots. He also has ways to contribute through his Ongoings. &nbsp;</p>",
